676
00:20:15.67 --> 00:20:16.84
Шашылыңдар!

677
0:20:16.08 --> 0:20:18.35
Aim between the rocks!

678
00:20:16.96 --> 00:20:19.25
...

679
0:20:18.88 --> 0:20:19.77
Let me.

680
00:20:19.92 --> 00:20:21.09
...

681
0:20:23.06 --> 0:20:24.24
You suck!

682
00:20:24.09 --> 00:20:25.14
...

683
00:20:26.93 --> 00:20:27.89
Ах

684
0:20:28.95 --> 0:20:31.44
Parona, give me your strength.

685
00:20:30.02 --> 00:20:32.48
...

686
0:20:34.16 --> 0:20:35.26
